---
description: RLM onboarding questions during initial project setup
alwaysApply: true
---

When initializing this template, configuring a new project or moving it to another
developer workstation, follow `docs/rlm-setup.md` together with `TEMPLATE.md`.
Ask whether to enable personal RLM; offer project registration with a verified
dump path and separately offer index creation. Ask for the user's RLM project
password only when needed; never invent, log or commit it. Existing matching
registrations must be reused. Missing server or dump must be reported explicitly.
Graph/code-metadata availability does not suppress these onboarding questions.
This setup exception does not change the source-search fallback rules.
